atime:DurationShape rdfs:label "Duration Shape"@en ;
    skos:definition "Applies to subjects using atime:duration. atime:duration takes at most one value; each is an xsd:decimal or xsd:integer literal at least 0."@en .
atime:duration skos:definition "The elapsed playing time of content expressed in seconds. It is a temporal extent, distinct from a timestamp or a count of frames or samples."@en .
